THE DEPARTMENT OF TRANSPORTATION

00:02:50.336 --> 00:02:54.040 line:78%
WITHIN THREE DAYS WERE ABLE TO

00:02:53.439 --> 00:03:00.613 line:78%
REOPEN THE BRIDGE.

