SO IT'S A LITTLE BIT MORE IN

00:03:22.368 --> 00:03:23.469 line:78%
DEPTH.

00:03:22.835 --> 00:03:24.070 line:78%
WE BELIEVE WE'LL HAVE IT DONE

00:03:23.570 --> 00:03:27.674 line:78%
THIS WEEK.

00:03:24.437 --> 00:03:30.076 line:78%
IN THE MEANTIME WE HAVE FIRST

00:03:28.007 --> 00:03:34.247 line:78%
RESPONDERS AND NATIONAL GUARD.

00:03:30.176 --> 00:03:36.516 line:78%
WE ARE BRINGING UTILITY WORKERS

00:03:34.347 --> 00:03:37.917 line:78%
