00:03:36.616 --> 00:03:38.585 line:78%
MAKING SENSE OF THE ELECTRIC

00:03:38.017 --> 00:03:40.787 line:78%
SITUATION.

00:03:38.685 --> 00:03:44.190 line:78%
WHEN I TOURED THAT IN PERSON,

00:03:40.887 --> 00:03:46.593 line:78%
YOU WOULD SEE CONCRETE UTILITY

00:03:45.425 --> 00:03:48.695 line:78%
POLES SNAPPED IN HALF.

00:03:46.693 --> 00:03:51.197 line:78%
THERE WAS A LOT OF DEBRIS.

00:03:48.928 --> 00:03:51.764 line:78%
SO THAT WILL TAKE A LOT OF

00:03:51.297 --> 00:03:53.533 line:78%
